b_paragraph\" >Secondly, tell friends from foes. Those who are trustworthy are the anchor points that will sustain your survival. Not everyone is your enemy, but keep an eye out for those that are.\u00a0 Work will your faction members to help each other survive in the harsh world, restore order, and rebuild a society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Thirdly, keep exploring and don't stop. Through the clash of the factions and the dark schemes of the Giant Corporations, find the truth behind the apocalypse in the North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lastly, take your PAX!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275120/extras/0cd0739ee56ea4aae7939aab81deed54.poster.avif?t=1747144257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275120/extras/0cd0739ee56ea4aae7939aab81deed54.webm?t=1747144257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275120/extras/0cd0739ee56ea4aae7939aab81deed54.mp4?t=1747144257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       The wasteland welcomes you, survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
